  "id": "creamy-cauliflower-brioche-and-bay-bake",
  "name": "Creamy Cauliflower, Brioche and Bay Bake",
  "subtitle": "Tender cauliflower in a rich mustard cheese sauce with a crisp brioche topping.",
  "description": "A creamy cauliflower side dish finished with nutmeg, bay, parmesan, and golden brioche cubes.",
  "meal_type": "side",
  "yield": {
